# Allowlist: everything is excluded unless re-included below. A new top-level
# directory, or a new top-level file other than *.py, that the image needs must
# be added here. A file the Dockerfile copies by name then fails the build; any
# other file is silently missing from the image.
*
!*.py
!requirements-prod.txt
!data/
!models/
!routes/
!seeds/
!services/
!utils/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
